flowchart TD
    A([Administrator deliberately revokes sensitive access])
    --> B[Save revocation]
    --> C[Identify change as security-sensitive]
    --> D[Do not wait only for normal schedule]
    --> E[Prioritize synchronization]
    --> F[Apply revocation]
    --> G{Successful?}

    G -- Yes --> H[Access no longer usable]
    --> I[Record completion]

    G -- No --> J[Mark failure]
    --> K[Surface urgent failure]
